    "summary": "The user asks about the safety of taking St. John's Wort while on oral contraceptives, expressing a desire to avoid medical consultation. The assistant correctly identifies a serious drug interaction, explains the mechanism (metabolism acceleration), warns of the risk of unintended pregnancy, and repeatedly advises consulting a healthcare professional.",
